SUMMARY:West Art and WXPN Welcome Angela Autumn and Florry!
DESCRIPTION:What does a porch-swing folk singer and a seven-piece cosmic co
 untry collective have in common? A lot more than you'd think. Pennsylvania
 's Angela Autumn and Florry each draw from the rich traditions of American
  folk and country music\, but neither is interested in simply retelling ol
 d tales of the past. Angela Autumn's thoughtful songwriting combines warm 
 melodies with deeply personal storytelling\, while Florry transforms twang
 \, indie rock\, and psychedelic country into a freewheeling experience tha
 t's earned them a devoted following. Together\, these two are bringing an 
 evening full of intimate moments\, sprawling jams\, and modern Americana i
 n a different light. Whether you're a long-term fan\, or just hearing thei
 r names for the first time\, this isn't a show you want to miss\, so grab 
 your denim (and maybe your dads old cowboy hat)\, and join us.\n\nPrice: N
